@startuml 05-auth-provider-and-account-linking-sequence
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans SC"
skinparam shadowing false
title 显式登录、三方认证与绑定冲突边界

participant "用户" as user
participant "客户端" as client
participant "identity与HTTP" as api
participant "官方提供方" as provider
participant "users与mobile聚合" as db
user -> client : 主动选择登录或绑定
client -> api : password / phone / email / oauth-start
api -> provider : 三方流程才请求官方授权与验证
provider -> api : 返回已验证身份
api -> db : 核对现有身份与显式create或link模式
db -> api : 原身份归属或冲突结果
api -> client : 返回会话或显式冲突；禁止静默合并
client -> api : 读取eligibility，登录不自动授予互动资格

@enduml
